{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject invalid exporter configuration at build time**\n\nThe builder accepts a null/blank bucket and non-positive record limits. Missing destinations fail only during export, where the plugin catches the exception and silently produces no record; non-positive limits disable truncation. Validate required destinations and positive limits before creating the client, apply equivalent validation to CloudWatch Logs and Lambda log exporters, and add invalid-configuration tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pooHP","finding_digest":"e8a5b44aec088cacad74b5c8f27217af254f94633bd01809b417ffe58546b79c","finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"88a511535efdefd7582d2529c5c6a12c7f4647b728486cee4b22e7ca962c1a8b","observation_id":"aro_v1_rcsrcu267xx5owbneuu4lrvbfr","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/S3Exporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","published_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_brd3pfs5righqijat55m42wkqi","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"3b6eb771df61db642c999e1d308344c97b3cf686","reviewer":"codex","start_line":135,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_jbdwi2xlsse74d2ixaimbmi7sf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
